# Published vs in this repo

**Published** means a visitor can open the page on https://rtikhonov.com.

These are **not** published:

- Files on `main`, a clean tree, or unpushed/pushed commits
- A green GitHub check
- Inspiration posts without `draft: true`

Never deploy with GitHub Pages or GitHub Actions. Ship only on Cloudflare
Workers from `rtikhonov.com/` on `cursor/cloudflare-workers-hosting`. Check
`wrangler whoami` first, then `npm run deploy`, then curl the live URL.

This `main` root app is not production. GitHub is version control only.

When asked about unpublished / live / public changes, check the live URL first. Then report git status as "in this repo" only.